Erdos339: positive upper density of restricted sumsets

Target: https://www.erdosproblems.com/339
Justin Sun Prize catalog: JSP-000281, SECOND question.
For every set A of natural numbers and every r, positive upper density
of the unrestricted r-fold sumset implies positive upper density of sums
of exactly r pairwise distinct elements of A.

Mathematics: Norbert Hegyvári, François Hennecart, Alain Plagne,
J. Reine Angew. Math. 560 (2003), 199-220.
